# Findings of the Trivy scan in the central CI pipeline that sit in the newest upstream base images
# (dpage/pgadmin4:9.18.0, postgres:17.11-bookworm; checked on Docker Hub 2026-10-24: no newer tag exists) and cannot be
# fixed here without patching packages inside images that deliberately run without root. Every entry expires on
# 2026-11-30: the build fails again then, so somebody has to look at the new upstream release. Remove entries as upstream
# releases the fixes.

